  "period_end": "2026-04-30",
  "title": "More models, finer controls",
  "summary": "April widened the model lineup and made Pollinations easier to use from apps, terminals, and the dashboard, while moving generation routes to Gen.\n\nACE-Step music, Qwen speech, GPT Image 2, DeepSeek V4, and Llama joined the lineup. Image reasoning modes and seeds for some audio and video models gave builders more control over the output.\n\nThe alpha polli CLI brought generation and account tools to terminals. The SDK gained image editing, dedicated audio calls, and device-code authorization; MCP gained broader model discovery and account tools.\n\nAPI-key management gained permissions, budgets, expiry dates, and clearer app consent. Enter added balance-based image estimates, per-key usage filters, and calendar-based reports with hourly views for individual days.\n\nCommunity submissions expanded the catalog across creative tools, chat, learning, games, and video. Repeated catalog cleanups removed broken links and made creator credits more accurate.",
